.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
After \f[CR]bc_debug_continue()\f[R], the debugger mode changes to
\f[CR]\(dqrun\(dq\f[R].
Execution will only stop again at the next matching breakpoint.
.IP \(bu 2
It is safe to call \f[CR]bc_debug_continue()\f[R] from within a
\f[CR]bc_break_hit_cb\f[R] callback.
The server queues the continue and resumes after the callback returns
and \f[CR]bc_poll()\f[R] yields control.
.IP \(bu 2
If no breakpoints remain or none match subsequent commands, execution
runs to completion after continue.
.IP \(bu 2
Thread safety: the client library is not thread\-safe.
